# The API keys this app reads, by name, with no values. Rent Check reads none:
# it calls no API, and its ONS figures ship beside app.py. If a later version
# ever needs a key, declare it under app_secrets in manifest.yaml, list its name
# here with no value, and set the value in Pippa: Apps > Created by me > your
# app > Keys. Never put a real key in this file: it is committed.
